# OCR models (~21MB) — NOT committed to git (keeps remote repo small).
# Fetched at build/dev time by scripts/download-ocr-models.ps1 into this dir,
# then bundled into the NSIS package via tauri.conf.json `bundle.resources`
# and copied to hermix_home()/ocr/ on first run by ensure_ocr_models().
# Offline build escape hatch: pre-place the 3 files here manually.
apps/desktop-tauri/src-tauri/resources/ocr/

# Custom-app runtime binaries (~12MB) — NOT committed to git (keeps remote
# repo small). Built/fetched at build/dev time by:
#   - scripts/build-app-shell.ps1  -> resources/shell/{app-shell.exe,WebView2Loader.dll}
#   - scripts/download-esbuild.ps1  -> resources/esbuild/esbuild.exe
# then bundled into the NSIS package via tauri.conf.json `bundle.resources`
# and copied to hermix_home()/shell/ + hermix_home()/esbuild/ on first run by
# ensure_app_shell_and_esbuild(). Offline build escape hatch: pre-place the
# files here manually.
apps/desktop-tauri/src-tauri/resources/shell/
apps/desktop-tauri/src-tauri/resources/esbuild/

# Editor / merge backup artifacts (never commit)
*.orig
*.original

# Root-level ad-hoc preview / upload temp files
/rainforest-bg-preview.html
/upload_*.jpg

# Agent-run work outputs & root preview leftovers
/outputs/
/approval-card-preview.html

# 手工安装的 npm tarball / 解包目录。pnpm 会跳过 wasm32 的 optionalDependencies，
# satteri 的浏览器侧 wasm 栈必须手工拉包，过程中留下这些中间产物。
satteri-win32.tgz
apps/desktop-tauri/_sat_pkg/
apps/desktop-tauri/satteri_verify.mjs

# 工具运行期的临时草稿（python 解包脚本留下的空文件等）
# 不带尾斜杠：这些残留实测是**文件**不是目录，`_tmp_*/` 匹配不到
apps/desktop-tauri/_tmp_*

